    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「ほぇえ？　ここ、よく見たらけっこう豪華な建物かも！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「『山小屋』って聞いてたから、どんな極限状態に放りこまれるのかって心配してたけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「しっかりした普請だし、調度もかなり高級っぽい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「『山小屋』っていうより、『マヨイガ（山中のお屋敷）』って感じ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「やたら日本刀とか猟銃とか飾ってあるのが、ちょっとコワいけど。これ本物かな～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「うわ、囲炉裏がある！　リアルで初めて見たっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「おっと。物珍しくてきょろきょろしちゃった、荷物の整理しとかないと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「お姉ちゃんが心配して、いろいろリュックに詰めてくれたんだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「でも、そんな必要なかったかも。お着替えとかぜんぶ、部長さんに借りられそうだし～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「わお、お姉ちゃんったら非常食とかまで用意してくれてる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「べつに、サバイバルするんじゃないんだけどなぁ。心配性だなぁ、お姉ちゃんは……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あれ？　もしかしてこの家って、電源ないのかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「家電とか見あたらないしなぁ、そのへんは『山小屋』っぽい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「コンセント……見あたらないなぁ？　う～む、携帯ゲームの充電もつかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「ううっ！　他のことなら我慢できるけど、ゲームできないのは無理！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「部長さんに、どっかに電源ないのか聞いてみよう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「えぇっと部長さんは、厨房にいるって言ってたかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「どこだろ、こっちかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「ていうか、あたし料理とか手伝ったほうがいいよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「つい、『まったり』しちゃったよ。あたし駄目だなぁ、いつも人任せで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「部長さんは、手伝わなくていいって言ってたけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あとで副部長に知られたら、『部長を働かせて自分だけ休むとは何事か！』って叱られちゃうかも？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「おっと、この部屋かな？　物音がするような？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「部長さ～ん！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あのう。よろしければ、やっぱりあたしが料理しますよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「じゃなくても、何かあたしにお手伝いできることはありませんか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「……うん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「何か、変な音がするような？　料理の音……じゃないよね、これ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「な、何だろ。嫌な予感がする。そおっと部屋のなかを覗いてみようかな、そお～っと？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（あっ、部長さん。何してるんだろ、部屋の隅っこで座りこんで……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（ていうか、これ厨房じゃないよね？　どう見ても！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（やたら抜き身の日本刀とか、刃物が並んでる！　何これ、武器庫？　鍛冶場？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（うわぁ、日本刀の刃がキラキラ輝いて……お星さまみたい☆　きれいだなぁ……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（って、見とれてる場合じゃない！　何かがおかしい！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（何なの、この部屋？　部長さんは、いったい何をしてるの……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（『しょり、しょり』って異音がするけど、これは研ぎ石と刃物が擦れる音？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（日本刀の刃を、研いでる……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（どうして？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「嬉しいなぁ、いい肉が手に入ったわさ♪　今日はご馳走だよ～う、にゃははは♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「せっかくの新鮮なお肉、大事に調理しないとね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「怯えさせたら肉が固くなって不味くなるから、油断させて安心させて……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「一息に、始末して～♪　血抜きをして、捌いて～♪　やわらかいお肉をお鍋でコトコト煮こんで～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは、よだれが垂れちゃうわさ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（………!?）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（え……？　何かブツブツ言ってると思ったら、何それ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（部長さんは、いったい何を言ってるの～っ!?）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（いい肉が手に入ったって、何のこと？　もしかして……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（『いい肉』って、あたしのこと？　まさかね？　でも、そんな……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（あ、あたしを食べるつもりなんじゃ……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（切り刻んで、血を抜いて、コトコト煮こんで……？　そ、そういうホラー映画を観たことある！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（ひぃいいっ!?　ゆ、油断した！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（ちょっと優しくされて、気を抜いてたけど。部長さんは、あの鬼の副部長の親分……！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（副部長よりもっと、ヤバいひとなのかも！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（そうだよ、あの鬼畜でサドい副部長が尊敬してるひとなんだ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（きっと副部長よりもっと残虐で、恐ろしいひとなんだっ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（油断したぁ～っ!?　だ、騙されるところだった！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "（ににに、逃げなきゃ！　あああ、あたし食べられちゃう～っ!?）"
